SUMMARY:[Computer Vision & Pattern Recognition][Machine Learning] WACV 2028
  - Round 1 new-paper enrollment deadline (estimated)
DESCRIPTION:Conference title: IEEE/CVF Winter Conference on Applications of
  Computer Vision\nWebsite: https://wacv.thecvf.com/\nSource URL: https://
 wacv.thecvf.com/Conferences/2027/CallForPapers\nLocation: Waikoloa\, Hawa
 ii\, USA\nTopics: Computer Vision & Pattern Recognition\, Machine Learnin
 g\, Deep Representation Learning\nSize: XL\nSubmission type: Paper-based 
 / two independent submission rounds\nConfidence: estimated\nLast checked 
 date: 2026-10-29\nNotes: As of 2026-10-29 the CVF conference list names W
 aikoloa\, Hawaii as the WACV 2028 host\; dates and calls are unannounced.
  Main-conference dates and both rounds' enrollment and paper deadlines (A
 oE) are one-year proxies from WACV 2027.\nScope: Applied computer vision 
 and visual learning\, with an emphasis on practical recognition\, detecti
 on\, segmentation\, image/video analysis\, 3D perception\, and deployable
  visual systems. Human analysis and multimodal visual methods are establi
 shed areas. Compared with the flagship trio\, WACV particularly welcomes 
 meaningful application-driven contributions supported by sound evaluation
 \; its two submission rounds are routes\, not different fields.\nAddition
 al topics: Signal Processing\, Biometrics & Human Sensing\, Multimedia Le
 arning & Retrieval\nScope sources (2027): https://wacv.thecvf.com/Confere
 nces/2027/CallForPapers\nScope last checked: 2026-10-07
URL:https://wacv.thecvf.com/Conferences/2027/CallForPapers
